          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሕዛብን ፡ እንድትከለክላቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወለኵሎሙ ፡ እለ ፡ አምኑ ፡ እምውስተ ፡ አይሁድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢይግዝሩ ፡ ደቂቆሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከአይሁድም ፡ ወገን ፡ ያመኑት ፡ ልጆቻ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸውን ፡ እንዳይገዝሩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢይግበሩ ፡ ሕገ ፡ ኦሪት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕገ ፡ ኦሪትን ፡ እንዳይፈጽሙ ፡ እንድትከ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለክላቸው ፡ ነግረዋቸው ፡ በዚህ ፡ ብቻ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አዝነዋል ፡ እንጅ ፡ ም ፡ ፲፮ ፥ ፫ ። ሮሜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲ ፥ ፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፳፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፪ ፤ ⟪ወይእዜኒ ፡ ሀለዎሙ ፡ ይስምዑ ፡ ከመ ፡ መጻ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እከ ፡ ዝየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሁንም ፡ ከዚህ ፡ መምጣትህን ፡ ይሰሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘንድ ፡ አላቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": "፳፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፫ ፤ ⟪ወከመዝ ፡ ግበር ፡ ዘከመ ፡ ንብለከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደምንነግርህ ፡ አድርግ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ሀለዉ ፡ ኀቤነ ፡ አርባዕቱ ፡ ዕደው ፡ እለ ፡ ቦሙ ፡ ብፅ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓት ፡ ያንጽሑ ፡ ርእሶሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከኛ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ በዓለ ፡ አንጽሖ ፡ ያደርጉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘንድ ፡ ብፅዓት ፡ ያለባቸው ፡ አራት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰዎች ፡ አሉ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": "፳፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፬ ፤ ⟪ንሥኦሙ ፡ ወሰዶሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይዘሃቸው ፡ ተለይ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአንጽሕ ፡ ርእሰከ ፡ ምስሌሆሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንተም ፡ ከነሱ ፡ ጋራ ፡ እንደነሱ ፡ በዓለ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንጽሖ ፡ አድርግ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአስተዋፅእ ፡ በእንቲአሆሙ ፡ ከመ ፡ ይትላፀዩ ፡ ርእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሶሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራሳቸውን ፡ ይላጩ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ስለነሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የምላጩን ፡ ዋጋ ፡ አወጣጣ ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሰው ፡ ይለዩ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ የሚለዩበትን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀን ፡ ቆጥረህ ፡ ንገራቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወያእምሩ ፡ ኵሎሙ ፡ ከመ ፡ ሐሰት ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ዘየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐምዩከ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁሉም ፡ አንተን ፡ የሚነቅፉበት ፡ ነገር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐሰት ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ ያውቁ ፡ ዘንድ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወከመ ፡ ተዐቅብ ፡ አንተሂ ፡ ሕገ ፡ ኦሪት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንተም ፡ ሕገ ፡ ኦሪትን ፡ እንድትጠብቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያውቁ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ንገራቸው ፡ ም ፡ ፲፰፥ ፲፰።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": "፳፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፭ ፤ ⟪ወበእንተሰ ፡ አሕዛብ ፡ እለ ፡ የአምኑ ፡ ንሕነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አዘዝነ ፡ ከመ ፡ ይትዐቀቡ ፡ ዘይትሔረሙ ፡ እምዘ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይዘብሑ ፡ ለአማልክት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስላመኑ ፡ አሕዛብ ፡ ግን ፡ ለጣዖት ፡ ከሚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሠዉት ፡ መሥዋዕት ፡ ይከለከሉ ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚከለከሉበትን ፡ ሥራት ፡ ሠርተናል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሉት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእምዝሙት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዝሙት ፡ ይከለከሉ ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእማውታ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሙቶ ፡ የተገኘውን ፡ ከመብላት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወደም ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደም ፡ ከመብላት ፡ ይከለከሉ ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐተታ ፡ ደሙ ፡ ሲረጋ ፡ አንፍረው ፡ ቆል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተው ፡ ይበሉታልና ፡ ም ፡ ፲፭ ፥ ፳ ፥ ፳፱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": "፳፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፮ ፤ ⟪ወነሥኦሙ ፡ ጳውሎስ ፡ ለእሙንቱ ፡ ዕደው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወተቀደሰ ፡ ምስሌሆሙ ፡ ወቦአ ፡ ምኵራበ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጳውሎስም ፡ እሊያን ፡ አራቱን ፡ ሰዎች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይዞ ፡ ተለየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወነገሮሙ ፡ መዋዕለ ፡ ዕድሜ ፡ ንጽሖሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከምኵራቡ ፡ ገብቶ ፡ ከሰው ፡ የሚለዩበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትን ፡ ቀን ፡ ቆጥሮ ፡ ነገራቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስከ ፡ ያበውኡ ፡ መሥዋዕተ ፡ ለለአሐዱ ፡ እምኔ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከነሱ ፡ አንዱም ፡ አንዱም ፡ መሥዋዕት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እስኪሠዉ ፡ ድረስ ፡ ነገራቸው ፡ ሐተታ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብፅዓት ፡ ያለበት ፡ ሰው ፡ ስድስት ፡ ቀን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
